dc_device_param: a resistor from 1 V into a diode whose area (an instance parameter) is swept over listed values; v(out) falls as the area grows. A continued sweep: refused for ngspice until R75's per-axis continuation (U0415)
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/diode.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model dm sp_diode is=1e-14
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=1.0
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
d1 (out 0) dm area=1.0
control
  sweep sw instance="d1" parameter="area" values=[1.0, 2.0, 4.0]
    analysis dc1 op
endc
